  "minions2": {
    "_about": "Only used by ?v=minions2: the minions crowd covering the whole visible floor, horizon to the bottom edge. Anything not set here comes from the minions section. ring and hero_clear keep the crowd off the hero (ring in hero heights, hero_clear in screen units), ripple_s is how long the hero's lights and boom take to ripple out to the furthest mini.",
